        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.141,
                0.504,
                0.158
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "考点1：边界条件对双零法的影响"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.169,
                0.433,
                0.186
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1)不同边界条件下双零法求解",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.192,
                0.201,
                0.804,
                0.275
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} {y ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-}) \\Rightarrow y _ {z i} (t) + y _ {z s} (t) = y (t)} \\\\ {y ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+}) \\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {y _ {z s} (t) \\stackrel {\\text {解形式}} {\\Longrightarrow} y (t) \\Rightarrow y _ {z i} (t) = y (t) - y _ {z s} (t)} \\\\ {y _ {z i} (t) \\text {含系数} \\Rightarrow y (t) = y _ {z i} (t) \\text {含系数} + y _ {z s} (t) \\stackrel {y ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+})} {\\Longrightarrow} y _ {z i} (t) \\Rightarrow y (t)} \\end{array} \\right.} \\end{array} \\right.\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.332,
                0.471,
                0.348
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2)给0_状态值，求解系统完全响应",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.356,
                0.476,
                0.372
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 20: 描述某LTI系统的微分方程为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.342,
                0.382,
                0.653,
                0.4
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 y (t) = 2 f ^ {\\prime} (t) + 6 f (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.407,
                0.812,
                0.449
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "已知 \\( y(0_{-})=2,y^{\\prime}(0_{-})=1,f(t)=u(t) \\) ，求该系统的零输入响应、零状态响应和全响应。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.194,
                0.568,
                0.499,
                0.584
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(3) 给 \\(0_{+}\\) 状态值, 求解系统完全响应:",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.593,
                0.477,
                0.608
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 21: 描述某LTI系统的微分方程为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.342,
                0.618,
                0.653,
                0.637
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 y (t) = 2 f ^ {\\prime} (t) + 6 f (t)\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.645,
                0.811,
                0.686
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "若已知 \\( y(0_{+})=3,\\quad y'(0_{+})=1,\\quad f(t)=u(t) \\) ，求该系统的零输入响应和零状态响应。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
