        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.11,
                0.528,
                0.127
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "考点 3: LTIS双零法视角下响应求解"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.139,
                0.792,
                0.155
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "原理：①零输入与初始状态呈线性关系 ②零状态与激励呈线性和时不变关系。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.185,
                0.811,
                0.255
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 24: 已知一线性时不变系统, 在相同初始条件下, 当激励为 \\(e(t)\\) 时, 其全响应为 \\(r_1(t) = [2e^{-3t} + \\sin(2t)]u(t)\\); 当激励为 \\(2e(t)\\) 时, 其全响应为 \\(r_2(t) = [e^{-3t} + 2\\sin(2t)]u(t)\\) 。求:",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.262,
                0.671,
                0.278
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(1)初始条件不变，当激励为 \\( e(t-t_{0}) \\) 时的全响应 \\( r_{3}(t), t_{0}>0; \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.286,
                0.644,
                0.303
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2)初始条件增大1倍，当激励为 \\(0.5e(t)\\) 时的全响应 \\(r_4(t)\\)。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.185,
                0.445,
                0.793,
                0.46
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 25: 某LTI连续系统, 其初始状态一定, 已知当激励为 \\(f(t)\\) 时, 其全响应为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.387,
                0.468,
                0.61,
                0.485
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {1} (t) = e ^ {- t} + \\cos (\\pi t), t \\geq 0\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.491,
                0.56,
                0.507
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "若初始状态不变，激励为 \\(2f(t)\\) 时，其全响应为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.405,
                0.516,
                0.592,
                0.531
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {2} (t) = 2 \\cos (\\pi t), t \\geq 0\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.538,
                0.587,
                0.553
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "求初始状态不变而激励为 \\(3f(t)\\) 时，系统的全响应。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.16,
                0.883,
                0.373,
                0.898
            ],
            "angle": 0,
