            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "例 26：某二阶 LTI 连续系统的初始状态为  \\( x_{1}(0) \\)  和  \\( x_{2}(0) \\) ，已知当  \\( x_{1}(0)=1, x_{2}(0)=0 \\)  时，其零输入响应为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.395,
                0.158,
                0.603,
                0.175
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {z i 1} (t) = e ^ {- t} + e ^ {- 2 t}, t \\geq 0\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.187,
                0.182,
                0.533,
                0.198
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "当 \\(x_{1}(0) = 0, x_{2}(0) = 1\\) 时，其零输入响应为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.395,
                0.205,
                0.602,
                0.223
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny _ {z i 2} (t) = e ^ {- t} - e ^ {- 2 t}, t \\geq 0\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.187,
                0.229,
                0.625,
                0.245
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "当 \\(x_{1}(0) = 1, x_{2}(0) = -1\\)，而输入为 \\(f(t)\\) 时，其全响应为",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "equation",
            "bbox": [
                0.415,
                0.253,
                0.583,
                0.269
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\[\ny (t) = 2 + e ^ {- t}, t \\geq 0\n\\]"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.186,
                0.275,
                0.601,
                0.292
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "求当 \\( x_{1}(0)=3,x_{2}(0)=2 \\) ，输入为 \\( 2f(t) \\) 时的全响应。",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
